WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:02.335
-My next guest
is a terrific actor

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:04.570
who you know from
"Game of Thrones," "Narcos,"

00:00:04.570 --> 00:00:07.640
and he stars
in "The Mandalorian."

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:10.042
He's unbelievable
in "The Mandalorian."

00:00:10.042 --> 00:00:13.212
Well, you can also see him in
"Wonder Woman 1984,"

00:00:13.212 --> 00:00:16.716
which will be in select theaters
and IMAX Christmas Day,

00:00:16.716 --> 00:00:20.919
and it will also be available
on the same day on HBO Max.

00:00:20.919 --> 00:00:23.522
Here is Pedro Pascal!

00:00:23.522 --> 00:00:25.358
Yeah, look at you, buddy.

00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:26.625
It's always great to see you.

00:00:26.625 --> 00:00:28.728
Thank you so much
for being here.

00:00:28.728 --> 00:00:30.163
-Look at you, man.
I love your hair.

00:00:30.163 --> 00:00:33.799
-You like it?
-Yeah. I like the relaxed...

00:00:33.799 --> 00:00:35.868
-It's kind of out of control
and you don't know

00:00:35.868 --> 00:00:37.603
where it's going to go.
-...all alone

00:00:37.603 --> 00:00:39.272
in the studio look.
I like it a lot.

00:00:39.272 --> 00:00:43.076
-Hey, "Wonder Woman 1984"
comes out next week,

00:00:43.076 --> 00:00:47.580
and tomorrow is the season
finale of "The Mandalorian."

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:52.151
This is a pretty amazing time
to be you right now

00:00:52.151 --> 00:00:55.922
in this crazy time
and this crazy world,

00:00:55.922 --> 00:00:58.290
but I just want to thank you
for all the content

00:00:58.290 --> 00:01:00.960
and the stuff you have us
look forward to.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:04.130
It's really helpful for us.

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:06.832
-Well, yeah. I mean, as you
say it, it makes me sweat.

00:01:06.832 --> 00:01:10.136
-Nah, no pressure. No pressure.

00:01:10.136 --> 00:01:13.306
Although, I'm assuming you're
getting phone calls like crazy

00:01:13.306 --> 00:01:16.676
about like "Hey, can you hook me
up with a Baby Yoda doll?

00:01:16.676 --> 00:01:18.411
Can you get me a Baby Yoda?"

00:01:18.411 --> 00:01:20.046
-I'm totally way ahead of it.

00:01:20.046 --> 00:01:21.848
-You knew it was going
to happen.

00:01:21.848 --> 00:01:27.187
-I've been my friends',
all the ones with kids anyway,

00:01:27.187 --> 00:01:29.222
my friends' favorite person for
a while.

00:01:29.222 --> 00:01:31.758
Not that I get much,
to be honest with you.

00:01:31.758 --> 00:01:36.128
I stole a little Lego piece
from the very first

00:01:36.128 --> 00:01:41.401
kind of Mandalorian Star Wars
toy experience that I had,

00:01:41.401 --> 00:01:43.402
and I was like, "Oh,
dude I'm going to take this,

00:01:43.402 --> 00:01:46.372
literally this size Lego.

00:01:46.372 --> 00:01:48.774
I'm just putting it my pocket
and I'll take it with me.

00:01:48.774 --> 00:01:51.144
And I got a call."
-Oh, they knew?

00:01:51.144 --> 00:01:52.711
-Oh, yeah.
-Wow!

00:01:52.711 --> 00:01:54.480
How are you with keeping
secrets?

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:56.982
How do you keep Baby Yoda
a secret

00:01:56.982 --> 00:01:58.784
to the whole entire world?

00:01:58.784 --> 00:02:03.356
-That was the first time that
I kept a secret

00:02:03.356 --> 00:02:07.727
and I didn't even tell my --
like, I told no one.

00:02:07.727 --> 00:02:10.797
You know, Kristen Wiig was on
your show just a little bit ago.

00:02:10.797 --> 00:02:13.932
-Yep.
She was talking about how good

00:02:13.932 --> 00:02:16.736
she follows the rules.
-Yeah. She didn't tell anyone.

00:02:16.736 --> 00:02:18.404
She didn't mention --
not allowed to really

00:02:18.404 --> 00:02:20.940
talk about it now even.
-Yeah.

00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:23.977
Well, so she had this like
cocktail thing,

00:02:23.977 --> 00:02:25.445
get-together thing in London

00:02:25.445 --> 00:02:28.815
before we started shooting
officially. You know?

00:02:28.815 --> 00:02:32.251
And, you know, for everyone

00:02:32.251 --> 00:02:34.220
to kind of meet and chat
and get together.

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:38.257
And I met two of her very close
friends.

00:02:38.257 --> 00:02:42.494
And they were asking what I was
doing in the movie.

00:02:42.494 --> 00:02:46.465
And I was like, "Oh, and I --,"

00:02:46.465 --> 00:02:51.137
I was like, "Well, you know, and
this guy, and --

00:02:51.137 --> 00:02:54.607
who sort of is alongside --
Kristen.

00:02:54.607 --> 00:02:56.275
I'm sure Kristen has
told you everything.

00:02:56.275 --> 00:02:59.646
They're like, "No, no, no."
She says she's not allowed

00:02:59.646 --> 00:03:02.214
to talk about it." And these are
like two of her best friends."

00:03:02.214 --> 00:03:04.050
-Yeah. She takes it seriously.

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:07.519
-I literally told

00:03:07.519 --> 00:03:11.057
the entire plot
to my Uber driver

00:03:11.057 --> 00:03:14.560
on the way to that --
to those cocktails.

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:16.028
He was like, "So what are you
doing in London?"

00:03:16.028 --> 00:03:17.429
I was like "Oh,
I'm shooting a movie."

00:03:17.429 --> 00:03:18.964
They're like,
"What's the movie?"

00:03:18.964 --> 00:03:21.568
I was like, "It's a big movie,
you know, it's 'Wonder Woman.'"

00:03:21.568 --> 00:03:22.769
And he was like,
"What's the character?"

00:03:22.769 --> 00:03:24.002
And I was like,
"Oh, well I got to start

00:03:24.002 --> 00:03:25.138
from the beginning here, so --"
-Oh, my gosh.

00:03:25.138 --> 00:03:26.706
-This is what he does.
-Oh, my gosh.

00:03:26.706 --> 00:03:30.175
-This is what happens.
-Oh, my gosh.

00:03:30.175 --> 00:03:33.712
-Anyway, I was like, you know,
he doesn't care

00:03:33.712 --> 00:03:35.715
or he's not going to believe me.
So --

00:03:35.715 --> 00:03:38.884
-He kept your secret, man.
Did you ever see him again?

00:03:38.884 --> 00:03:41.721
-I realized once Kristen was,
like, not telling her,

00:03:41.721 --> 00:03:44.957
you know, she wasn't telling her
fiancé at the time.

00:03:44.957 --> 00:03:47.125
She wasn't telling anybody.
-I've seen the movie.

00:03:47.125 --> 00:03:48.961
She still wouldn't tell me
what she did in the movie.

00:03:48.961 --> 00:03:51.930
I know everything.
She was like,

00:03:51.930 --> 00:03:54.400
"Yeah. Yeah. I'm so close.
Why ruin it now?"

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:56.735
Like, I don't care.
I'm totally fine with you.

00:03:56.735 --> 00:03:58.871
-Well, I'm here to ruin it.
What do you want to know?

00:03:58.871 --> 00:04:00.906
-[ Chuckles ]
No, I won't let you do that.

00:04:00.906 --> 00:04:04.443
How did you get cast
in the movie?

00:04:04.443 --> 00:04:07.112
Did you know Patty before this,
or --

00:04:07.112 --> 00:04:10.750
-Yeah. I had met Patty.
I worked with her on a pilot

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:12.151
that never saw the light of day.

00:04:12.151 --> 00:04:17.189
And this was a role that
had a very kind of small part

00:04:17.189 --> 00:04:19.158
in the pilot actually,
so I just got to work with her

00:04:19.158 --> 00:04:21.761
for a couple days, but was an
incredible fan of hers.

00:04:21.761 --> 00:04:25.831
Like, I'd seen "Monster"
and everything she had done

00:04:25.831 --> 00:04:31.237
on TV, and so I actually got
a call from the movie's producer

00:04:31.237 --> 00:04:33.772
Chuck Roven who I was working
with on something at the time,

00:04:33.772 --> 00:04:37.510
and he said that Patty wanted to
talk to me about a role

00:04:37.510 --> 00:04:41.747
in "Wonder Woman," and I talked
with her and had this

00:04:41.747 --> 00:04:43.615
incredible conversation with her
on Skype.

00:04:43.615 --> 00:04:46.586
And she described this really,
really cool character.

00:04:46.586 --> 00:04:48.421
But I didn't have a script.

00:04:48.421 --> 00:04:52.892
And I also just wasn't really
registering

00:04:52.892 --> 00:04:55.361
that she wanted me
to play the part.

00:04:55.361 --> 00:04:59.832
I didn't see how that would be
possible without, you know,

00:04:59.832 --> 00:05:01.467
killing myself trying to get it,
really.

00:05:01.467 --> 00:05:04.570
Because, I mean, I've done much
more for a guest spot

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:06.739
on, like, "Law &amp; Order"
you know?

00:05:06.739 --> 00:05:08.541
Criminal intent.
You know what I'm saying?

00:05:08.541 --> 00:05:10.042
-That's the secret
for any actor out there.

00:05:10.042 --> 00:05:12.578
-Three callbacks for it.
-Wow.

00:05:12.578 --> 00:05:15.080
Yeah, isn't that amazing, right?
-Yeah.

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:18.851
-So then I had to fly to London
to go and have

00:05:18.851 --> 00:05:21.187
like a, you know --
I had the part.

00:05:21.187 --> 00:05:24.923
And they were just asking me to
go to London to do fittings

00:05:24.923 --> 00:05:26.592
and to sit down with Patty
and to talk about it

00:05:26.592 --> 00:05:28.627
and everything like that.
I still didn't have a script.

00:05:28.627 --> 00:05:33.299
And I wasn't asking --
I wasn't asking for anything.

00:05:33.299 --> 00:05:34.500
You understand what I'm saying?
-Yeah, yeah.

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:36.969
-I was just like,
"Let me be a part of this."

00:05:36.969 --> 00:05:39.871
I got to read the script
leaving London.

00:05:39.871 --> 00:05:42.475
I read it on the plane.
You know?

00:05:42.475 --> 00:05:46.578
And I didn't -- you know,
it could have been, you know --

00:05:46.578 --> 00:05:49.548
It could have been a piece of
furniture and I would have

00:05:49.548 --> 00:05:51.750
said yes to it.

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:55.521
I kept on seeing his name on the
pages and I was like,

00:05:55.521 --> 00:05:56.989
"I can't believe this."

00:05:56.989 --> 00:05:58.457
-You gave it to your Uber driver
like,

00:05:58.457 --> 00:06:00.960
"What do you think about this?"
[ Laughter ]

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:02.328
-Yeah. The flight attendant.

00:06:02.328 --> 00:06:03.930
Do you think I should --
Did I do the right thing?

00:06:03.930 --> 00:06:05.263
-You got any notes for this?

00:06:05.263 --> 00:06:07.232
I don't know. I could read it
over the loud speaker

00:06:07.232 --> 00:06:08.568
if you want me to.
-[ Laughs ]

00:06:08.568 --> 00:06:10.769
-I want to show everyone
a clip from the movie.

00:06:10.769 --> 00:06:14.207
Here is Pedro Pascal
in "Wonder Woman 1984."

00:06:14.207 --> 00:06:15.741
Take a look.

00:06:15.741 --> 00:06:20.279 line:0%
♪♪

00:06:20.279 --> 00:06:24.850 line:0%
♪♪

00:06:24.850 --> 00:06:27.486
-Well, aren't you resourceful?
-Come with me.

00:06:27.486 --> 00:06:30.923
-No, I don't think so.
Remove this woman, please...

00:06:30.923 --> 00:06:32.391
permanently.

00:06:32.391 --> 00:06:34.359
-[ Grunting ]
[ Gunfire ]

00:06:34.359 --> 00:06:35.094
Aah!

00:06:35.094 --> 00:06:37.396
-[ Grunting ]

00:06:37.396 --> 00:06:40.165
[ Both grunt, groan ]

00:06:40.165 --> 00:06:43.402
-Are you okay?
-I don't know.

00:06:43.402 --> 00:06:47.406 line:0%
♪♪

00:06:47.406 --> 00:06:49.041
[ Grunts ]

00:06:49.041 --> 00:06:55.013 line:0%
♪♪

00:06:55.013 --> 00:06:57.750
-Pedro Pascal,
"Wonder Woman 1984"

00:06:57.750 --> 00:07:00.152
will be in select theaters
and IMAX Christmas Day

00:07:00.152 --> 00:07:02.555
and available the same day
on HBO Max.

00:07:02.555 --> 00:07:04.757
Thank you so much for being here
as always, buddy.

00:07:04.757 --> 00:07:06.125
it's always good to see you.

00:07:06.125 --> 00:07:07.960
You keep crushing it on
everything.

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:10.396
Oh, my gosh.
"Wonder Woman," "Mandalorian."

00:07:10.396 --> 00:07:12.365
Come on.
Happy holidays to you, bud.

